    <tags>cypher-music music-player video-player audio downloader vocal-remover stem-separation karaoke offline</tags>
    <summary>Offline music and video player with a link downloader and an on-device vocal and instrument separator.</summary>
    <description>Cypher Music is a full offline media library — songs, albums, artists, playlists and videos, all scanned from the machine it runs on. On top of the player it carries two things most players do not: a downloader that pulls audio or video from hundreds of sites, and a vocal and instrument separator that pulls a finished track apart into its vocal and instrumental stems. Both of them run on your own computer or phone, with nothing uploaded anywhere.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kencypher56/cypher-releases/releases/tag/cypher-music-v2.141</releaseNotes>
